# --- Material not yet released to students -------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC, so a file committed here is readable even when
# course.json `published` withholds it from the website. Unreleased sessions'
# notes and decks therefore stay untracked until their week.
#
# To release a session: delete its lines below, add the session id to
# `published` in course.json, then commit both together.

